op('coprime','Maximum','Fraction','[(()=>{const gcd=(a:number,b:number):number=>b===0?a:gcd(b,a%b);let n=0;for(let a=1;a<=p[0];a++)for(let b=1;b<=p[0];b++)if(gcd(a,b)===1)n++;return n/(p[0]*p[0]);})()]',lambda p:[sum(math.gcd(a,b)==1 for a in range(1,int(p[0])+1) for b in range(1,int(p[0])+1))/p[0]**2],'Choose two independent integers uniformly from 1 through {Maximum}. What exact fraction of ordered pairs is coprime?','Finite enumeration gives a finite-range fraction. The limiting six-over-pi-squared result is a separate asymptotic statement.','grid')
op('gaussclass','Prior DistanceA DistanceB Variance','PosteriorA','[p[0]*Math.exp(-p[1]*p[1]/(2*p[3]))/(p[0]*Math.exp(-p[1]*p[1]/(2*p[3]))+(1-p[0])*Math.exp(-p[2]*p[2]/(2*p[3])))]',lambda p:[p[0]*math.exp(-p[1]**2/(2*p[3]))/(p[0]*math.exp(-p[1]**2/(2*p[3]))+(1-p[0])*math.exp(-p[2]**2/(2*p[3])))],'Two toy equal-variance Gaussian classes have prior A {Prior}; the point is DistanceA {DistanceA}, DistanceB {DistanceB} from their means; variance {Variance}. What is posterior A?','Soft membership weighs densities and priors. A hard nearest-center label discards this uncertainty and may ignore unequal class priors.','grid')
