op('uniformsumcap','Cap','Expected','[Array.from({length:p[0]},(_,i)=>1/Array.from({length:i},(_,j)=>j+1).reduce((a,b)=>a*b,1)).reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0)]',lambda p:[sum(1/math.factorial(i) for i in range(int(p[0])))],'Add independent Uniform(0,1) draws until their sum exceeds 1, but stop after Cap {Cap}. What is the expected number of draws used?','The survival-sum expectation uses the simplex probability 1/n factorial. Increasing the cap approaches a limit; individual draw counts remain variable.','grid')
