op('ehrenfest','Particles Initial Steps','Expected','[p[0]/2+(p[1]-p[0]/2)*Math.pow(1-2/p[0],p[2])]',lambda p:[p[0]/2+(p[1]-p[0]/2)*(1-2/p[0])**p[2]],'A toy Ehrenfest urn has {Particles} particles, initially {Initial} on the left. Each step moves one uniformly selected particle across. What is expected left count after {Steps} steps?','The mean relaxes toward half, while realized counts continue fluctuating. An expectation is not a deterministic equilibrium path.','grid')
